Zstandard 1.5.7
================

These files are the single-threaded compression and decompression portions of
upstream Zstandard 1.5.7 from https://github.com/facebook/zstd.  Dictionary
building, legacy formats, multithreaded compression, the thread pool, tests,
programs, and assembly are not imported.

Local kernel adaptations are confined to:

	common/zstd_kernel.h
	common/zstd_deps.h
	common/compiler.h
	common/debug.h
	common/mem.h
	common/xxhash.h
	common/zstd_trace.h
	compress/zstd_preSplit.h
	zstd.h

They replace libc headers and allocation with OpenBSD kernel facilities,
disable runtime CPU dispatch and assembly, strip diagnostics and unused
stack-heavy helpers, and force one-shot compression contexts onto the heap.
The upstream BSD license is in LICENSE.
